"""
scbd_utils.py — generic per-student feedback PDFs for the SCBD exam family
(DDS3-CBD Case Based Discussion, SCBD_OM-OS Oral Med / Oral Surg, ...).

Input  : a per-exam sheet exported by scbd_gradio.py (row 1 = merged section
         headings, row 2 = column headings "MCn (/d)", one row per student),
         e.g. SCBD/CBD/DDS3 CBD cleaned comments.xlsx -> "DDS3-CBD (2)".
Output : one A4-landscape PDF per student (Surname_Given_ID_<tag>_Feedback.pdf,
         ID is the first digit group -> works with StudentReportMailer) + _index.csv.

Scoring is recomputed from the MC columns (sheet totals are only cross-checked):
  * section total = Σ MC score / Σ MC max (blank MCs excluded from both)
  * every exam config has "parts" -> part % by method
        "sum"      : Σraw / Σmax over the matched sections         (pooled)
        "itemNorm" : mean(score/max) over the matched MCs          (OS style)
  * Overall % = Σ part% × weight  (weights should sum to 1)
Add a new exam = add an entry to EXAM_CONFIGS.

Usage (main.ipynb):
    from scbd_utils import *
    idx = buildScbdReports("SCBD/CBD/DDS3 CBD cleaned comments.xlsx", "DDS3-CBD (2)", "DDS3-CBD",
                           outDir="SCBD/CBD/CBD_Feedback_Reports")
"""
